{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42756","headline":"莲塘霁望 · 刘兼","name":"莲塘霁望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新秋菡萏发红英，向晚风飘满郡馨。\n万叠水纹罗乍展，一双鸂鶒绣初成。\n采莲女散吴歌阕，拾翠人归楚雨晴。\n远岸牧童吹短笛，蓼花深处信牛行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42756.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42756","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}